      "sourceHash": "3a26737aec160a2d",
      "translationZh": "AIE NYC 的门票即将售罄！下周见！",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eaa4f58e499e702f",
      "translationZh": "查看过去的 AINews 期刊以获取订阅者折扣。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d705816e47a822be",
      "translationZh": "为 Mistral 倒一杯，他们在最近的 Series D 资助的全新 3800 GB300 集群上发布了一个不错的 Large 4 “Le Chonk” 模型。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "98c42664a3f2d6cd",
      "translationZh": "但他们被 OpenAI 内部的 Navier-Stokes 数学模型所掩盖——该模型以博客文章、代码库和推文的形式发布。来自 Anthropic 的 Navier-Stokes 竞争者尽管与 OpenAI 有个人分歧，却毫不掩饰地说道：“这显然是数学史上最重要的时刻。”",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5106271bb6c8bf62",
      "translationZh": "这虽然有一些限制，但大多数专家似乎同意它解决了数学中前 500 个开放问题中的许多。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1e6766b2ef1d2b78",
      "translationZh": "特别是，结果 003，即准黎曼假设，介于菲尔兹奖级别的成果与“过去 200 年数论领域最大的成果”之间。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c56f1b6039e441d9",
      "translationZh": "最令人惊讶的是——Navier-Stokes 用了 88 小时和 10,000 个代理，而这些解决方案平均仅需 3 小时的 ChatGPT Pro。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
